{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33696","headline":"长安即事 · 林宽","name":"长安即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暝鼓才终复晓鸡，九门何计出沈迷。\n樵童乱打金吾鼓，豪马争奔丞相堤。\n翡翠鬟欹钗上燕，麒麟衫束海中犀。\n须知不是诗人事，空忆泉声菊畔畦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林宽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33696.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33696","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}